    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tuburcĭnor</span></b> , ātus,
		1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep.
				a.</i>, <i>to eat greedily</i>, <i>gobble up</i>, <i>devour</i> (syn. voro): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">raptim manducare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Non. 179, 21</span></i>
			 (ante- and postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de suo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 1, 3, 42</span></i>
			; Titin. and Turp. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 1</span></i>.
			1.!*? <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tuburcĭnātus</span></b> , a, um,
			in a <i>pass.</i> signif.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prandio raptim tuburcinato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 6, p. 183, 30</span></i>
			.</div>
